description:
1.负责资产事业部年度经营预算编制、执行监控、财务分析及经营决策支持，开展财务稽核与内控监督；
2.负责不良债权(资产)业务财务环节财税专业支持、业务及项目全流程财务风险管控及项目经营决策支持;
3.参与资产管理项目尽职调查及评审工作，从财务视角出具专业意见。

requirements:
1.中专及以上学历，市场营销、工商管理等相关专业优先。
2.1年以上白酒行业或相关行业的工作经验，拥有酒企市场招商、渠道开拓、经销商等经验优先考虑;
3.具备渠道管理经验，熟悉酒行业产品特性及区域市场运作逻辑。

description:
1. Forecast and plan individual selling target, execute and drive results to meet a set target; keep follow-up with existing orders end to end to ensure the smoothness of order fulfillment;
2. Manage and support distributors of assigned region; explore new promising overseas market and work to enhance Mindray product branding recognition in the local area as well as improve market coverage;
3. Present Mindray products in professional fairs and exhibitions; keep management informed by submitting activity reports, work plan and territory market analyses;
4. Monitor competition by gathering current marketplace information on pricing, products, new products, delivery schedules;
5. Resolve customer complaints by investigating problems, developing solutions, preparing reports and making recommendations to management team;
6. Feedback to R&D team according to sales status with the purpose of product optimization.

requirements:
1. Bachelor degree or above, majoring in engineering or equivalent, mechanical and electrical engineering, bio-medical, human science or related disciplines; 
2. Minimum 3 years working experience in international sales, sales experience in the field of medical device is preferred; 
3. Excellent communication skills in English, Spanish is preferable;
4. Excellent capability in business expansion and account management;
5. Able to travel frequently in LATAM Countries.
